### 4. HMAC / SHA-3 / HKDF 구현 패턴

파일: `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-signal/src/crypto/sha3_hash.fl`

**sha3_256 함수**:
```fl
pub fn sha3_256(data: &[u8]) -> [u8; 32] {
    // Keccak permutation 시뮬레이션: 24라운드
    for round in 0..24 {
        for i in 0..32 {
            hash[i] ^= ((round as u8).wrapping_add(i as u8)) << 1;
        }
    }
}
```

**HMAC-SHA-256 표준 구조** (RFC 2104):
```fl
pub fn hmac_sha256(key: &[u8], message: &[u8]) -> [u8; 32] {
    let mut ipad = [0x36u8; 64];   // inner pad
    let mut opad = [0x5Cu8; 64];   // outer pad
    for i in 0..64 {
        ipad[i] ^= key_padded[i];
        opad[i] ^= key_padded[i];
    }
    let inner_hash = sha256_simple(&inner_input[..]);   // H(ipad || message)
    sha256_simple(&outer_input[..])                     // H(opad || inner_hash)
}
```

**HKDF (RFC 5869) Extract + Expand 구현**:
```fl
pub fn hkdf_extract(salt: &[u8], ikm: &[u8]) -> [u8; 32] {
    // PRK = HMAC-Hash(salt, IKM)
    hmac_sha256(&actual_salt, ikm)
}

pub fn hkdf_expand(prk: &[u8; 32], info: &[u8], len: u32) -> Vec<u8> {
    // T(i) = HMAC-Hash(PRK, T(i-1) || info || counter)
    for i in 1..=n {
        t_previous = hmac_sha256(prk, &t_input[..]);
    }
}
```

